 "description": "Compare two snapshots of captured challenges and report every price movement per resource. Amounts are compared as exact integers, so a large atomic amount is never collapsed by floating point. Reports a resource that was priced before and is absent after, a rise beyond a tolerance you set, and a new resource that appeared. Nothing is paid. Pay 130000 atomic USDC on Base via exact x402. MCP does not pay; it provides a challenge handoff.",
